  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Documenting CAFOD Projects and Impact Through Film</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The purpose of this assignment is to highlight the work of CAFOD&#x2019;s within targeted communities through the development of documentaries.The documentary will be aimed at reaching external audiences and should therefore provide an overview of CAFOD and its partners, and the impact of their work on all levels. Hearing directly from the community members themselves through the medium of film will effectively illustrate the impact of our projects.</narrative>
  </description>
